<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Delete your account — RK Classes</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/icons/favicon.png?v=3"/>
<style>
  body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;margin:0;background:#f9fafb}
  .wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 18px 60px}
  h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 4px;color:#b91c1c} h2{font-size:18px;margin:24px 0 8px}
  p,li{font-size:15px} .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px} a{color:#2563eb}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Delete your RK Classes account / data</h1>
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px;">
    <p>You can ask the institute to delete your account and the personal data linked to it (for a parent account: the account
    and the phone number; for staff: the login). Student academic and fee records are kept by the institute as school records
    unless you ask for them to be removed too.</p>

    <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Send an e-mail to <a href="mailto:rkclasseskapilsir2002@gmail.com?subject=Delete%20my%20RK%20Classes%20account">rkclasseskapilsir2002@gmail.com</a>
          with the subject <b>"Delete my RK Classes account"</b>.</li>
      <li>Write the registered phone number or username, your name, and (for a parent) your child's name and class, so we can identify you.</li>
      <li>We will confirm by reply and delete the account within <b>30 days</b>.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The login (username / phone and password) and its access rights.</li>
      <li>Any data you asked us to remove, except records the institute must keep by law (for example fee receipts).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>See also our <a href="/Home/PrivacyPolicy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
